==== hyperbricks yaml {!{hypermedia}} ====
hypermedia:
  - type: hypermedia
  - beautify: "false"
  - title: Home
==== explainer ====
Override server.beautify for this object when rendered directly
==== expected json ====
{
  "Beautify": false,
  "BodyTag": "",
  "Cache": "",
  "ConfigCategory": "",
  "ConfigType": "<HYPERMEDIA>",
  "ContentType": "",
  "Cookies": null,
  "Doctype": "",
  "Enclose": "",
  "Favicon": "",
  "Head": null,
  "Headers": null,
  "HtmlTag": "",
  "HyperBricksFile": "",
  "HyperBricksKey": "",
  "HyperBricksPath": "",
  "Index": 0,
  "Items": null,
  "MetaDocDescription": "",
  "NoCache": false,
  "Route": "",
  "Section": "",
  "Static": "",
  "Template": null,
  "Title": "Home"
}

==== expected output ====
<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta name="generator" content="hyperbricks runtime"><title>Home</title></head><body></body></html>
